# Stream.io Video Configuration
# Get these values from https://getstream.io/
# 1. Sign up and create a new app
# 2. Copy your API key from the dashboard
# 3. Generate a user token for testing (in production, use server-side token generation)

VITE_STREAM_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
VITE_STREAM_USER_TOKEN=your_user_token_here
